ed loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476790/extras/fea9e646344ea29bb5da76fb43a957b9.poster.avif?t=1743453807\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476790/extras/fea9e646344ea29bb5da76fb43a957b9.webm?t=1743453807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476790/extras/fea9e646344ea29bb5da76fb43a957b9.mp4?t=1743453807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476790/extras/94c1e2a372a33b6c4fa23f164f9e6363.poster.avif?t=1743453807\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476790/extras/94c1e2a372a33b6c4fa23f164f9e6363.webm?t=1743453807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476790/extras/94c1e2a372a33b6c4fa23f164f9e6363.mp4?t=1743453807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476790/extras/f1d09b224450cfa356e68f756dfca73a.poster.avif?t=1743453807\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476790/extras/f1d09b224450cfa356e68f756dfca73a.webm?t=1743453807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476790/extras/f1d09b224450cfa356e68f756dfca73a.mp4?t=1743453807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476790/extras/37955ef79dccc1d59b7a2f8892a99e7d.poster.avif?t=1743453807\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476790/extras/37955ef79dccc1d59b7a2f8892a99e7d.webm?t=1743453807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476790/extras/37955ef79dccc1d59b7a2f8892a99e7d.mp4?t=1743453807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476790/extras/e56dc959ee9966c3d68abaa7a843dfd8.poster.avif?t=1743453807\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476790/extras/e56dc959ee9966c3d68abaa7a843dfd8.webm?t=1743453807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476790/extras/e56dc959ee9966c3d68abaa7a843dfd8.mp4?t=1743453807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Version 1.02 Major Update</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >70 types of ambient white noise</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ ground textures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ wall textures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ dust and weather effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >900+ new decorative objects, including natural landscapes, steampunk themes, and fantasy worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 types of gemstones that drop when feeding fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three selectable desktop aquarium sizes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clock and Pomodoro timer can now be freely dragged</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >31 LOFI music tracks</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cozy Aquarium \u2013 Relax, Decorate, and Immerse Yourself</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Cozy Aquarium</strong>, an experience that blends relaxation with productivity. Immerse yourself in a beautifully designed world where you can create, decorate, and manage your very own aquarium while enjoying soothing Lofi music. Whether you want to unwind after a long day or enhance your focus, <strong>Cozy Aquarium</strong> offers the perfect escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Aquarium Decoration</strong> \u2013 Customize your aquarium with a variety of aquatic plants, decorations, and colorful fish. Let your creativity flow and craft your own underwater paradise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc20 <strong>Aquarium Management</strong> \u2013 Build and maintain a thriving aquarium! Take care of your fish, attract visitors, and earn coins to expand and upgrade your aquatic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd52 <strong>Productivity Tools</strong> \u2013 Stay focused with built-in features like the <strong>Pomodoro Timer</strong> and <strong>To-Do List</strong>, helping you balance relaxation with efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Calming Lofi Soundtrack</strong> \u2013 Sit back, relax, and enjoy a carefully curated selection of Lofi tracks that create the perfect atmosphere for your aquarium adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Stress-Free Gameplay</strong> \u2013 No rush, no pressure \u2013 <strong>Cozy Aquarium</strong> lets you play at your own pace and enjoy a peaceful experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy Aquarium is more than just a game \u2013 it\u2019s a peaceful retreat from the busyness of everyday life.</strong> Whether you love decorating, managing, or simply unwinding, this cozy game is the perfect choice for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a deep breath, dive into the world of <strong>Cozy Aquarium</strong>, and let the serenity wash over you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cozy Aquarium \u2013 Relax, Decorate, and Immerse Yourself</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Cozy Aquarium</strong>, an experience that blends relaxation with productivity. Immerse yourself in a beautifully designed world where you can create, decorate, and manage your very own aquarium while enjoying soothing Lofi music. Whether you want to unwind after a long day or enhance your focus, <strong>Cozy Aquarium</strong> offers the perfect escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Aquarium Decoration</strong> \u2013 Customize your aquarium with a variety of aquatic plants, decorations, and colorful fish. Let your creativity flow and craft your own underwater paradise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc20 <strong>Aquarium Management</strong> \u2013 Build and maintain a thriving aquarium! Take care of your fish, attract visitors, and earn coins to expand and upgrade your aquatic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd52 <strong>Productivity Tools</strong> \u2013 Stay focused with built-in features like the <strong>Pomodoro Timer</strong> and <strong>To-Do List</strong>, helping you balance relaxation with efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Calming Lofi Soundtrack</strong> \u2013 Sit back, relax, and enjoy a carefully curated selection of Lofi tracks that create the perfect atmosphere for your aquarium adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Stress-Free Gameplay</strong> \u2013 No rush, no pressure \u2013 <strong>Cozy Aquarium</strong> lets you play at your own pace and enjoy a peaceful experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy Aquarium is more than just a game \u2013 it\u2019s a peaceful retreat from the busyness of everyday life.</strong> Whether you love decorating, managing, or simply unwinding, this cozy game is the perfect choice for you.</p><p cla